ent-ms:RiskAssessmentShape ent-gov:definedIn "enterprise-governance/docs/standards/06-ai-risk-and-controls.md" ;
    ent-gov:justifiedBy ent-adr:ADR-0011 .
ent-ms:EnterpriseRuleShape ent-gov:definedIn "enterprise-governance/docs/adr/README.md" ;
